---
/**
 * Specialization — second biology-lens concept at Collective scale.
 * Division of labor among member Cells within a multicellular form.
 * Order: Multicellularity → Specialization → Regulation.
 * Keep inline tags on one line with outer spaces (Astro whitespace).
 * No em-dashes in public copy.
 */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Specialization | Identity Engineering">
	<main class="min-h-screen">
		<section class="min-h-[50vh] flex flex-col justify-center pt-28 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40 mb-6">
					Biology lens · Collective Identity
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-[0.95] mb-6 text-white">
					Specialization
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl text-white/50 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
					Division of labor inside a multicellular form:
					member Cells take distinct roles without ceasing to be Cells of the same whole.
				</p>
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/20 bg-amber-500/[0.04] p-4">
					<p class="text-sm text-white/65 leading-relaxed">
						<strong class="text-white/80">Status:</strong> Working concept under the biology lens.
						Primary science reading: cell differentiation / tissue specialization.
						Analogy, not isomorphism. Follows
						<a href="/framework/multicellularity" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Multicellularity</a>;
						precedes Regulation.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Definition</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Same whole, different work.</h2>
				<p>
					In biology, multicellular organisms do not keep every cell identical.
					<strong class="text-white/85">Specialization</strong> (differentiation) assigns roles: muscle, nerve, epithelium, immune cell.
					Members remain cells of one organism; their functions diverge so the whole can do more than any uniform pile of cells.
				</p>
				<p>
					In Identity Engineering, Specialization names that division of labor under the biology lens.
					After
					<a href="/framework/multicellularity" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Multicellularity</a>
					establishes a higher-order living form, Specialization is how member
					<a href="/framework/cell" class="text-white/85 underline decoration-white/25 hover:decoration-white/50">Cells</a>
					take distinct roles without leaving the Collective Identity or dissolving their own Boundaries.
				</p>
				<p>
					This is not hierarchy as domination by default. It is structured difference in function inside one organized whole.
					Regulation (next) is how those roles stay coordinated over time.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">What Specialization is</div>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Role differentiation:</strong> members of the collective perform different functions for the whole.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Held under one form:</strong> specialized Cells remain part of the same Multicellularity; difference is not exit.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Capacity expansion:</strong> the whole gains abilities no uniform member set could sustain alone.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Prerequisite of Regulation:</strong> without distinct roles, multi-speed control of the collective has nothing structured to coordinate.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">What Specialization is not</div>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not Multicellularity itself.</strong>
						The higher-order form can exist before deep role split. Specialization is the internal differentiation of that form.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not Regulation.</strong>
						Roles are the layout; regulation is the ongoing control and damping of the whole.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not loss of member Boundary.</strong>
						A specialized Cell is still a Cell. Role is not erasure of unit identity.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not caste metaphysics.</strong>
						Biological differentiation is the science reading. The framework does not import fixed social hierarchy as natural law.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-rose-400/30 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Not every difference as specialization.</strong>
						Noise and accidental divergence are not organized division of labor for the whole.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Order in the biology lens</div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Multicellularity → Specialization → Regulation</h2>
				<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-3 text-lg">
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Multicellularity</strong> — higher-order living form exists</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Specialization</strong> — members take distinct roles for the whole</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white/85">Regulation</strong> (next) — multi-speed coordination and damping of that differentiated whole</li>
				</ol>
				<p>
					Specialization answers: <em class="text-white/75">how does the collective gain structured internal difference without falling apart?</em>
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16 border-b border-white/10">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[4px] text-white/40">Engineering</div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What we work on</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-5 text-lg">
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Name roles without erasing members:</strong> function for the whole, Boundary still real.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Prefer designed difference over accidental drift:</strong> specialization is organized, not mere variance.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Keep the collective as the unit of purpose:</strong> roles serve the whole; the whole is not only a stage for roles.
					</li>
					<li class="border-l border-white/15 pl-5">
						<strong class="text-white/85">Prepare regulation:</strong> differentiated systems need coordination or they tear themselves apart.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-8 py-16">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-white/55 leading-relaxed">
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/[0.04] p-6 text-base">
					<div class="mb-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-[3px] text-cyan-300/80">Science reading</div>
					<p>
						Primary discipline: <strong class="text-white/80">cell differentiation / tissue specialization</strong>.
						Regulation completes the Collective scale next.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
					<a href="/framework/multicellularity" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Multicellularity</a>
					<a href="/framework/coupling" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Coupling</a>
					<a href="/framework/living-identity" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:bg-white/5 transition">Living Identity</a>
					<a href="/framework" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-black font-medium hover:bg-white/90 transition">Framework</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
